SUMMARY: Manna Food Distribution
DESCRIPTION:East Flat Rock First Baptist Church hosts a monthly food driv
 e through Manna Food Bank. Anyone can receive food from this ministry. Fo
 od boxes are packed ahead of time.\n\nDistribution is run as a drive-thro
 ugh\, and you never have to leave your car.\n\nEach month\, unless specif
 ied\, arrive by 10:30 a.m. Distribution stops at 11:30 a.m.\n\nIf you wou
 ld like a reminder call the day before each distribution day\, please cal
 l the church office at (828) 692-0765 to be added to the Call Alert syste
 m.
CATEGORIES:Drive-Through,Pre-Packed-Boxes,Food-Distribution
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:East Flat Rock First Baptist Church hosts a monthly 
 food drive through Manna Food Bank. Anyone can receive food from this min
 istry. Food boxes are packed...
LOCATION:East Flat Rock First Baptist Church
CREATED:20260917T154937Z
DTSTAMP:20260919T042009Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260917T154937Z
TRANSP:OPAQUE
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
