SUMMARY: Providence House Community Meal
DESCRIPTION:Worship Meal | Providence Congregation https://providencecong
 regation.org/meal/\n\nEach Sunday afternoon\, volunteers from Providence 
 and other local churches host a hot meal for anyone who needs something t
 o eat.\n\nThe volunteers also distribute toilet packets and some clothing
  items (such as socks). After the meal\, a store is opened\, and the rema
 ining food is made available to those present and wishing to take food ho
 me.
CATEGORIES:Community-Meal
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:No registration required. No limits on visits.
LOCATION:Providence House\,1201 Oakland St\, Hendersonville\, NC 28792\, 
 USA
