SUMMARY: Upward Food Pantry
DESCRIPTION:Upward Food Pantry | Facebook https://www.facebook.com/people
 /Upward-Food-Pantry/61581839335251/\n\nNumbers handed out at 9:00 am to h
 old place in line. Once you have it\, you may leave if you wish. But you 
 must be back by 11:00 am to be handed out a beeper. When you get the beep
 er\, you MUST stay on church property until opening at 12:00 pm.\n\nIf yo
 u don't want to wait in line very long\, come at 1:30 pm.
