SUMMARY: IAM Pantry
DESCRIPTION:IAM Food and Personal Hygiene Assistance https://www.iam-hc.o
 rg/get-help#provided\n\nIndividuals and families who need assistance may 
 visit the IAM pantry during regular service hours:\n\nMonday\, Tuesday\, 
 and Thursday: 9 a.m. to 4 p.m.\nWednesdays and Fridays: 9 a.m. - 12:30 p.
 m.\n\nRegular Food assistance is available once every two weeks. Henderso
 n County residency and proof of income are not required to receive food a
 ssistance. IAM adheres to TEFAP guidelines for TEFAP specific food items.
 \n\nAvailability of individual items may vary depending on donations and 
 current inventory.
