SUMMARY: The Storehouse Food Pantry
DESCRIPTION:Get Help | The Storehouse of Henderson County https://storeho
 useonline.org/get-help\n\n\nWhat to Expect & Bring\n\nEligibility: Assist
 ance is available to residents of Henderson County facing food insecurity
 .\n\nWhat to Bring: Valid photo ID and proof of Henderson County residenc
 y (like a recent utility bill\, lease agreement\, or official mail with y
 our current address).\n\nNo appointment necessary. You can visit the pant
 ry during regular operating hours. Service is generally provided on a fir
 st-come\, first-served basis.\n\nThe Process: Volunteers will greet you\,
  help you with a brief registration\, and provide you with a selection of
  fresh and non-perishable food items.
