SUMMARY: Mills River Life Enrichment Center
DESCRIPTION:Mills River Life Enrichment Center https://www.mrlec.org/\n\n
 Lunch reservations are required. Please call the MRLEC office at (828) 80
 8-5581 by 12 noon the Tuesday before each program.\n\nPlease arrive by 10
 :30 am.\n\n10:00 to 10:30 Fellowship Time\n\n  * Coffee\, tea\, water\, c
 ookies and crackers available for snacking\n  * Magazine\, book & puzzle 
 swap\n  * Blood pressure checks\n\n10:30 to 11:00\n\n  * Announcements\n 
  * Door prizes\n  * Trivia\n  * Chair Exercises\n  * Devotion\n  * Prayer
  Time\n\n11:00 Weekly program\n\n  * May include but not limited to music
 al entertainment\, BINGO\, healthy tips about aging\, medical tips\n  * M
 onthly Calendar https://www.mrlec.org/calendar\n\n12:00 Lunch provided\n\
 nWhen Henderson County Public Schools are closed OR on a delay MRLEC will
  NOT meet.
CATEGORIES:Community-Meal,Prepared-Meal
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:Reservations required
LOCATION:Fellowship Hall of Mills River UMC\,137 Old Turnpike Rd\, Mills 
 River\, NC 28759\, USA
CREATED:20260917T140848Z
DTSTAMP:20260919T042009Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260917T141755Z
TRANSP:OPAQUE
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
